---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="Learn about our company, mission, and commitment to quality industrial products.">
  <section class="hero" style="padding: 3rem 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About TradeSite Industrial</h1>
      <p>Your trusted partner in industrial machinery and mechanical components.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Story</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
        TradeSite Industrial was founded with a simple mission: to connect global buyers
        with high-quality industrial products at competitive prices. With over 15 years
        of experience in international trade, we understand the unique challenges of
        sourcing industrial components across borders.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Commitment</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-green-500 text-xl">&#10003;</span>
          <span><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong> Every product undergoes rigorous quality inspection before shipment.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-green-500 text-xl">&#10003;</span>
          <span><strong>Competitive Pricing:</strong> Direct factory relationships ensure the best prices for our clients.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-green-500 text-xl">&#10003;</span>
          <span><strong>Fast Response:</strong> Our team responds to all inquiries within 24 hours.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-green-500 text-xl">&#10003;</span>
          <span><strong>Global Logistics:</strong> Reliable shipping to 50+ countries with full tracking.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Certifications</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        Our products meet international standards including ISO 9001, CE, and RoHS compliance.
        We maintain strict quality management systems to ensure consistency across all shipments.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
